4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,820
welcome you

5
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:13,430
Officially join our inner circle

6
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:15,150
That activist force outside

7
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:17,790
What we study is just ordinary folk culture

8
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:21,180
